  data: {
    LLM: "Priority one: The **Sake Cup** (Kiku-ni-Sakazuki). It is the most powerful card in the deck as it allows you to form the Moon-Viewing and Flower-Viewing yaku with only two cards.\n\nDenial: Watch your opponent's captured pile. If they have two 'Blue Ribbons', your primary goal is to capture the third Blue Ribbon to prevent them from scoring 5 points, even if it doesn't help your own Yaku.\n\nWhen to call 'Koi-Koi': Only call it if you have a clear path to adding another 1 or 2 points (e.g., you need one more Ribbon) AND you know your opponent is missing the key cards for their own Yaku.",
