      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "The Paulownia (December) suit is mostly 'Chaff' (1 pt cards but useful for the 10-chaff yaku). Don't ignore it.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'If you have four of the same suit in your hand at the start, it is an automatic 6-point yaku (Teshi).',
